@EventPlanning_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5024

GET http://localhost:5024/secret
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:5024/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get one event by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1
Accept: application/json

### Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Team dinner",
  "date": "2026-12-05T18:30:00Z",
  "location": "Oslo",
  "description": "Annual team dinner"
}

### Delete an event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1